const prevVol = { num: 5, title: 'Beastkind Stronghold &amp; Skalla Infiltration', href: `${baseUrl}walkthrough/volume-5/` };
const nextVol = { num: 7, title: 'The Final Battle &amp; True Epilogue', href: `${baseUrl}walkthrough/volume-7/` };
---

<WalkthroughLayout
  volume={6}
  volumeTitle="Granorg Liberation &amp; Shadow of Dias"
  chapterRange="Chapters 51–60"
  description="Assault on Granorg Castle, overthrowing Protean Queen Protea, confronting Field Marshal Viola, and unmasking Hugo's fanatical plot."
  stats={stats}
  quickJumps={quickJumps}
  prevVol={prevVol}
  nextVol={nextVol}
>

  <!-- Chapter 51 -->
  <ChapterCard
    id="ch51"
    number={51}
    title="Skalla (Alternate Chapter 4)"
    timeline="Alternate"
  >
    <TacticalBriefing
      level="55" party="Stocke, Gafka, Rosch" inn="100 G"
    />

    <div class="chapter-walkthrough-prose">
      <ShopMatrix title="Skalla (Alternate Chapter 4) Merchant" items={[{"name": "Soothing Balm", "price": 100}, {"name": "First Aid Kit", "price": 400}, {"name": "Tourniquet", "price": 1000}, {"name": "Herbal Tea", "price": 350}, {"name": "Special Tea", "price": 1200}, {"name": "Healing Herb", "price": 500}, {"name": "Holy Water", "price": 500}, {"name": "Anti-Poison", "price": 50}, {"name": "Anti-Fear", "price": 50}, {"name": "Anti-Paralytic", "price": 50}, {"name": "Anti-Curse", "price": 50}, {"name": "Anti-Sleep", "price": 50}, {"name": "Anti-Stone", "price": 50}, {"name": "Panacea", "price": 800}, {"name": "Poison Wing", "price": 350}, {"name": "Sleep Wing", "price": 500}, {"name": "Power Down", "price": 500}, {"name": "Magic Down", "price": 500}, {"name": "Might Herb", "price": 500}, {"name": "Magic Herb", "price": 500}]} equipment={[{"name": "Bastard Sword", "price": 4000}, {"name": "Alchemy Edge", "price": 9500}, {"name": "Goldy Lance", "price": 4300}, {"name": "Witch Spear", "price": 4800}, {"name": "Steel Gauntlet", "price": 3400}, {"name": "Mueke Knife", "price": 3800}, {"name": "Death Dagger", "price": 5200}, {"name": "Rune Dagger", "price": 12000}, {"name": "Solid Slugs", "price": 3800}, {"name": "Freikugel Argent", "price": 6500, "note": "buy for Eruca"}, {"name": "Iron Mail", "price": 2400}, {"name": "Bloody Armor", "price": 4800, "note": "buy for Rosch"}, {"name": "Gold Clothes", "price": 3200}, {"name": "White Gold Wear", "price": 8600}, {"name": "Iron Breastplate", "price": 6500}, {"name": "Running Sand", "price": 3800}, {"name": "Bestial Soul", "price": 7600, "note": "buy for Gafka"}, {"name": "Gold Dress", "price": 5100}, {"name": "Shadowrun Dress", "price": 5600}, {"name": "Thorned Dress", "price": 6900}, {"name": "Iron Charm", "price": 2500}]} itemTitle="Item Shop" equipmentTitle="Equipment Shop" />
      <p>Unfortunately, if you do that, the nearest node is the "A New Alliance" node, and you will have to go all the way through Lazvil Hills and Judgement Cliff again.  However, if you use Stocke's Vanish ability and bypass all the enemies, you can make it back to Skalla in a couple minutes.  Return to the same decision and choose to "Send soul to heavens" to advance the [Wandering Soul] sidequest.  When you are ready, rest up at the inn, leave Skalla, and head for the Itolia Wasteland.</p>
      <Callout type="note" title="Recommended Equipment">
        <p>Recommended Equipment at this point in the game<br/>
        <strong>Stocke:</strong> Pieti Edge, Moirae Manteau, Crystal Charm x3<br/>
        <strong>Raynie:</strong> Witch Spear, Sable Larme, Crystal Charm x3<br/>
        <strong>Marco:</strong> Gaia Blade, Tungsten Mail, Bishop Stud x3<br/>
        <strong>Rosch:</strong> Titanium Lance, Bloody Armor, Beast Charm, Iron Charm x2<br/>
        <strong>Aht:</strong> Promised Knife, Life Robe, Bishop Stud x3<br/>
        <strong>Gafka:</strong> Alloy Gauntlet, Bestial Soul, Iron Charm x3<br/>
        <strong>Extra:</strong> Freikugel Argent, Gospel Armor</p>
      </Callout>
    </div>
  </ChapterCard>

  <!-- Chapter 52 -->
  <ChapterCard
    id="ch52"
    number={52}
    title="Itolia Wasteland (Alternate Chapter 4)"
    timeline="Alternate"
  >
    <TacticalBriefing
      level="55" party="Stocke, Gafka, Rosch" enemies={[{"name": "Blood Panther"}, {"name": "Cygnus Archer", "weakness": "Sleep"}, {"name": "Cygnus Soldier"}, {"name": "Red Storm"}]}
    />

    <div class="chapter-walkthrough-prose">
      <AsciiMap>
<pre>__                          ________
               |  |         | |            |        |    S - Save Point
               /XX|       __| |            |        |    X - Roadblock
              /XXX|      |     \_____   ___|        |
             /XXXX|_     |       _ __   ___   ______|
            /       |    |___   | |        | |
           /       _|        |XX| |
          |       |___   ____|  | |        | |
          |                     | |__   __/S |
          |_       ___   ___    |____   __   |
            \_____/         \   \         \  |
                            |   /          | |
                            |  |           | |
   _____
  |     |  _______          |  |           | |            _____
  |     | |       |         |  |          /   \          /     \
  |_   _| |____   |         |XXX\____   _/     \___   __/       \__
    | |        |  |        /    X
          _____|  |__   __/     X____   __     ____   __         __
    | |__/                     /  __      \___/         \       /
    |____          __   __    |__/  |                    \_____/
         \________/       \         |
                           \       /
                            \   __/
                            |  |</pre>
      </AsciiMap>
      <p>There's only one exit you can use here.  Go east one screen, south two, and east one.  Take the eastern exit to reach the Abyssia Forest.</p>
    </div>
  </ChapterCard>

  <!-- Chapter 53 -->
  <ChapterCard
    id="ch53"
    number={53}
    title="Abyssia Forest (Alternate Chapter 4)"
    timeline="Alternate"
  >
    <TacticalBriefing
      level="55" party="Stocke, Gafka, Rosch" enemies={[{"name": "Blue Climb", "weakness": "Lightning"}, {"name": "Deep Eyes", "weakness": "Lightning"}, {"name": "Grand Bear", "weakness": "Fire"}, {"name": "Wizard", "weakness": "Sleep"}]}
    />

    <div class="chapter-walkthrough-prose">
      <AsciiMap>
<pre>|X|      X - Roadblock                   Head east one screen to find a Grand
__| |                             ____     Bear.  Bring in Aht &amp; Marco, then
__  |                            |  __     use the Change command to string
  | |___   ____  |X|        __   | |       together 10 turns to steal a
  |_____   __  | | |__   __/  \__| |       Master Fist ATK+50/MP+30/LUC+15) for
             | |_|  __   __________/       Gafka.  Otherwise, keep heading east
             |_____|                       until you reach Forgia.</pre>
      </AsciiMap>
    </div>
  </ChapterCard>

  <!-- Chapter 54 -->
  <ChapterCard
    id="ch54"
    number={54}
    title="Forgia (Alternate Chapter 4)"
    timeline="Alternate"
  >
    <TacticalBriefing
      level="56" party="Stocke, Gafka, Rosch"
    />

    <div class="chapter-walkthrough-prose">
      <ShopMatrix title="Forgia (Alternate Chapter 4) Merchant" items={[{"name": "Soothing Balm", "price": 100}, {"name": "First Aid Kit", "price": 400}, {"name": "Tourniquet", "price": 1000}, {"name": "Herbal Tea", "price": 350}, {"name": "Special Tea", "price": 1200}, {"name": "Holy Water", "price": 500}, {"name": "Anti-Poison", "price": 50}, {"name": "Anti-Fear", "price": 50}, {"name": "Anti-Paralytic", "price": 50}, {"name": "Anti-Curse", "price": 50}, {"name": "Anti-Sleep", "price": 50}, {"name": "Anti-Stone", "price": 50}, {"name": "Panacea", "price": 800}, {"name": "Poison Wing", "price": 350}, {"name": "Sleep Wing", "price": 500}, {"name": "Power Down", "price": 500}, {"name": "Might Herb", "price": 500}]} equipment={[{"name": "Iron Sword", "price": 2400}, {"name": "Sorcery Epee", "price": 4600}, {"name": "Rune Edge", "price": 5000}, {"name": "Iron Lance", "price": 2100}, {"name": "Magic Spear", "price": 3200}, {"name": "Bloody Pike", "price": 3700}, {"name": "Phase Spear", "price": 6800, "note": "buy for Raynie"}, {"name": "Bloody Claw", "price": 2500}, {"name": "Knife", "price": 1800}, {"name": "Red Dagger", "price": 2000}, {"name": "Vega", "price": 9000}, {"name": "Elemental Mail", "price": 4700}, {"name": "Gold Clothes", "price": 3200}, {"name": "Hymnal Cape", "price": 3700}, {"name": "Blessed Plate", "price": 7200}, {"name": "Rune Dress", "price": 4900}, {"name": "Fang Charm", "price": 1000}]} itemTitle="Item Shop" equipmentTitle="Equipment Shop" />
      <Callout type="node" title="Historia Milestone: Gafka's Homeland">
        <p>The shops are not open yet, but I figured I'd list them here anyway. To the left of the entrance is a hidden chest which contains 4000 G. On the opposite side to the right is another hidden chest which contains the STRONGMAN BOOK for Gafka later. In the northern half of the village, search the right side for a slightly concealed barrel. Drag it to the left to blow away the rocks to gain access to a chest which contains 2 TOURNIQUETS. Finally, climb up to the wooden deck and pass up the houses to the left. Search the upper left corner for a chest which contains the GIANT CAPE (DEF+45/MDF+33/SPD-3, equip on Aht).</p>
      </Callout>
      <p>Enter the upper house and talk to the elder, Galva, to discuss what you will need to do next.</p>
    </div>
  </ChapterCard>

  <!-- Chapter 55 -->
  <ChapterCard
    id="ch55"
    number={55}
    title="Skalla (Alternate Chapter 5)"
    timeline="Alternate"
  >
    <TacticalBriefing
      level="56" party="Stocke, Raynie, Marco"
    />

    <div class="chapter-walkthrough-prose">
      <ShopMatrix title="Skalla (Alternate Chapter 5) Merchant" items={[{"name": "Soothing Balm", "price": 100}, {"name": "First Aid Kit", "price": 400}, {"name": "Tourniquet", "price": 1000}, {"name": "Herbal Tea", "price": 350}, {"name": "Special Tea", "price": 1200}, {"name": "Healing Herb", "price": 500}, {"name": "Holy Water", "price": 500}, {"name": "Anti-Poison", "price": 50}, {"name": "Anti-Fear", "price": 50}, {"name": "Anti-Paralytic", "price": 50}, {"name": "Anti-Curse", "price": 50}, {"name": "Anti-Sleep", "price": 50}, {"name": "Anti-Stone", "price": 50}, {"name": "Panacea", "price": 800}, {"name": "Poison Wing", "price": 350}, {"name": "Paralysis Wing", "price": 350}, {"name": "Curse Wing", "price": 350}, {"name": "Sleep Wing", "price": 500}, {"name": "Stone Wing", "price": 500}, {"name": "Power Down", "price": 500}, {"name": "Magic Down", "price": 500}, {"name": "M.Def Down", "price": 500}, {"name": "Might Herb", "price": 500}, {"name": "Magic Herb", "price": 500}, {"name": "M.Def Herb", "price": 500}, {"name": "Medicloth", "price": 1000}]} equipment={[{"name": "Alchemy Edge", "price": 9500}, {"name": "Adamantine Sword", "price": 9500}, {"name": "Witch Spear", "price": 4800}, {"name": "Diamun Lance", "price": 9600}, {"name": "Diamond Gauntlet", "price": 3400}, {"name": "Death Dagger", "price": 5200}, {"name": "Rune Dagger", "price": 12000}, {"name": "Diamond Knife", "price": 9900}, {"name": "Freikugel Argent", "price": 6500}, {"name": "Hollowpoints", "price": 8400}, {"name": "Bloody Armor", "price": 4800}, {"name": "Adamantine Mail", "price": 9700}, {"name": "Gold Clothes", "price": 3200}, {"name": "White Gold Wear", "price": 8600}, {"name": "Running Sand", "price": 3800}, {"name": "Bestial Soul", "price": 7600}, {"name": "Diamond Lorica", "price": 11300}, {"name": "Shadowrun Dress", "price": 5600}, {"name": "Thorned Dress", "price": 6900}, {"name": "Platinum Dress", "price": 8200}, {"name": "Iron Charm", "price": 2500}, {"name": "Crystal Charm", "price": 2500}, {"name": "Rook Stud", "price": 6000}, {"name": "Mistel Ring", "price": 20000}, {"name": "Feather Armlet", "price": 30000}, {"name": "Obsidian", "price": 2500}, {"name": "Celestine", "price": 1750}, {"name": "Peridot", "price": 1750}, {"name": "Amazonite", "price": 1750}, {"name": "Amber", "price": 1750}]} itemTitle="Item Shop" equipmentTitle="Equipment Shop" />
      <Callout type="node" title="Historia Milestone: Battle for Skalla">
        <p>[Rosch's Stratagem node] Although the plot automatically takes you to Skalla, you can indeed leave and return to Forgia, which you should do to make the recommended purchases listed above. The Beast Charms should go to Gafka and Rosch. The Rook Studs should go to Aht and Marco.</p>
      </Callout>
      <p>Back at Skalla, the only new thing here is the cage with the Gutrals in it. Head to the inn to discuss your plan.  Afterwards, some soldiers will appear to the left of the inn.  Talk to them to initiate the plan.</p>
      <BossCard name="Alistel Officer, Alistel Soldier x2" weakness="None">
        <p><strong>Strategy:</strong> Alistel Officer has a Fidele Epee (ATK+58) that Stocke could use, but I prefer keeping him as a magic user.  Do not use Push Assaults on them, because this will put them in formation.  Instead, have Marco use Magic Rise to boost everyone's magic.  Use the Change command to string together at least five consecutive turns, then use two Right Assault and any three G-elemental spells to defeat the Soldiers.  Two more G-spells should finish the Officer.</p>
      </BossCard>
      <p>After defeating them, talk to Rosch again and tell him that you're ready to begin the next phase of the plan.</p>
    </div>
  </ChapterCard>

  <!-- Chapter 56 -->
  <ChapterCard
    id="ch56"
    number={56}
    title="Forgia (Alternate Chapter 5)"
    timeline="Alternate"
  >
    <TacticalBriefing
      level="56" party="Stocke, Gafka, Rosch"
    />

    <div class="chapter-walkthrough-prose">
      <ShopMatrix title="Forgia (Alternate Chapter 5) Merchant" items={[{"name": "Soothing Balm", "price": 100}, {"name": "First Aid Kit", "price": 400}, {"name": "Tourniquet", "price": 1000}, {"name": "Herbal Tea", "price": 350}, {"name": "Special Tea", "price": 1200}, {"name": "Healing Fruit", "price": 1500}, {"name": "Holy Water", "price": 500}, {"name": "Anti-Poison", "price": 50}, {"name": "Anti-Fear", "price": 50}, {"name": "Anti-Paralytic", "price": 50}, {"name": "Anti-Curse", "price": 50}, {"name": "Anti-Sleep", "price": 50}, {"name": "Anti-Stone", "price": 50}, {"name": "Panacea", "price": 800}, {"name": "Poison Wing", "price": 350}, {"name": "Sleep Wing", "price": 500}, {"name": "Power Down", "price": 500}, {"name": "Magic Down", "price": 500}, {"name": "M.Def Down", "price": 500}, {"name": "Might Herb", "price": 500}, {"name": "Magic Herb", "price": 500}, {"name": "M.Def Herb", "price": 500}, {"name": "Medicloth", "price": 1000}]} equipment={[{"name": "Iron Sword", "price": 2400}, {"name": "Sorcery Epee", "price": 4600}, {"name": "Rune Edge", "price": 5000}, {"name": "Slayer Sword", "price": 13000}, {"name": "Iron Lance", "price": 2100}, {"name": "Magic Spear", "price": 3200}, {"name": "Bloody Pike", "price": 3700}, {"name": "Phase Spear", "price": 6800}, {"name": "Death Pike", "price": 11200, "note": "buy for Rosch"}, {"name": "Bloody Claw", "price": 2500}, {"name": "Death Claw", "price": 4100, "note": "buy for Gafka"}, {"name": "Knife", "price": 1800}, {"name": "Red Dagger", "price": 2000}, {"name": "Vega", "price": 9000}, {"name": "Elemental Mail", "price": 4700}, {"name": "Tungsten Mail", "price": 6400, "note": "buy for Raynie"}, {"name": "Gold Clothes", "price": 3200}, {"name": "Hymnal Cape", "price": 3700}, {"name": "Skull Cape", "price": 4500}, {"name": "Blessed Plate", "price": 7200}, {"name": "Binding Plate", "price": 5300}, {"name": "Rune Dress", "price": 4900}, {"name": "Skull Dress", "price": 4300, "note": "buy for Eruca"}, {"name": "Fang Charm", "price": 1000}, {"name": "Iron Charm", "price": 2500}, {"name": "Beast Charm", "price": 5000}, {"name": "Rook Stud", "price": 6000}, {"name": "Flower Ring", "price": 10000}, {"name": "Mistel Ring", "price": 20000}, {"name": "Emerald", "price": 3600}, {"name": "Amethyst", "price": 3600}, {"name": "Sapphire", "price": 3600}, {"name": "Earth Drops", "price": 4000}, {"name": "Sky Drops", "price": 4000}]} itemTitle="Item Shop" equipmentTitle="Equipment Shop" />
      <Callout type="node" title="Historia Milestone: Skalla Liberated">
        <p>[Sand Fortress Siege node] After a lengthy scene, you will be back at Forgia. Talk to Galva to receive [The Beast God's Birth] sidequest. Unlike any other shop in the game, Forgia's shops change their inventory mid-chapter, where you should make the recommended purchased listed above.</p>
      </Callout>
      <p>Back at the village entrance, talk to Bergas to the right to receive the [Gafka &amp; the Scrolls] and [The Ultimate Skill] sidequests.  With the Strongman Book you found earlier, talk to him again and have Gafka fight him.  One shot of Gafka's Sky Hammer Mana Burst will defeat him.  For doing so, Gafka will learn Musou, which deals 10 hits per use, and is incredible for creating massive combos, though it only works on the center enemy.  If only there were another ability that would move all enemies to the center panel...</p>
      <p>Leave the village and head back to Skalla for some more scenes.  Before heading to the Sand Fortress, find Vanoss on the upper left side of town.  Talk to him to complete the [Wandering Soul] sidequest and receive the CLEANSING CAPE (DEF+30/MDF+36/MAG+5, sell).  Then, talk to Rosch to begin the invasion of the Sand Fortress.</p>
      <Callout type="note" title="Recommended Equipment">
        <p>Recommended Equipment at this point in the game<br/>
        <strong>Stocke:</strong> Pieti Edge, Moirae Manteau, Crystal Charm x3<br/>
        <strong>Raynie:</strong> Phase Spear, Tungsten Mail, Crystal Charm x3<br/>
        <strong>Marco:</strong> Gaia Blade, Tungsten Mail, Rook Stud x3<br/>
        <strong>Rosch:</strong> Death Pike, Bloody Armor, Beast Charm x3<br/>
        <strong>Aht:</strong> Promised Knife, Giant Cape, Rooks Stud x3<br/>
        <strong>Gafka:</strong> Death Claw, Bestial Soul, Beast Charm x3<br/>
        <strong>Extra:</strong> Freikugel Argent, Gospel Armor, Skull Dress</p>
      </Callout>
    </div>
  </ChapterCard>

  <!-- Chapter 57 -->
  <ChapterCard
    id="ch57"
    number={57}
    title="Sand Fortress (Alternate Chapter 5)"
    timeline="Alternate"
  >
    <TacticalBriefing
      level="56" party="Stocke, Gafka, Rosch" enemies={[{"name": "Alistel Soldier"}, {"name": "Auto Defender"}, {"name": "Prod. Thaumachine", "weakness": "Lightning"}]}
    />

    <div class="chapter-walkthrough-prose">
      <Callout type="node" title="Historia Milestone: Commander's Fall">
        <p>I'd recommend fighting every enemy you can around here to get some much-needed experience for Rosch &amp; Gafka. If necessary, Rosch's Cross Spike can be useful for taking out those Auto Defenders. Otherwise, just head straight up the middle to the third floor. Then, walk around the right side and up the stairs. Bring in Aht to replace Gafka and continue up to meet the commander.</p>
      </Callout>
      <BossCard name="Cannon x2, Thaumaton" weakness="Fire, Lightning">
        <p><strong>Strategy:</strong> Use a Magic Herb on Stocke and have him cast Heat Blade to take out the two Cannons.  Then, use a Magic Herb on Aht, lay out a couple Volt Star Traps, and Grapple the Thaumaton onto them for a quick victory.</p>
      </BossCard>
      <p>After the battle, Bergas will arrive to prompt you for a decision on your next move.  Make sure to choose "Bring back now", as this is a requirement to unlocking the [At Journey's End] sidequest.  Either way, the plot will proceed the same way.</p>
      <Callout type="node" title="Historia Milestone: Forbidden Weaponry">
        <p>Talk to Rosch and join the meeting. After some dialogue, you will be prompted for a decision. Choosing to "Accept the truce" will unlock the [Divine Judgement] ending.</p>
      </Callout>
      <Callout type="node" title="Historia Milestone: Etherion">
        <p>Before moving on, return to the "Gafka &amp; the Scrolls" node and head to Skalla. Talk to Marco by the item shop. If you have been following the walkthrough, you will finally receive the [At Journey's End] sidequest. If not, search for "At Journey's End" in the walkthrough to find the three prerequisites you need to make. Oddly enough, one of the choices occurs AFTER this point in the plot, yet affects it retroactively.</p>
      </Callout>
      <p>Talk to Raynie by the inn to be prompted for a decision.  Choosing "I'll stop fighting" will unlock the [Oncoming Calamity] ending.  Return to the same decision point and choose "I can't give up" to advance the [At Journey's End] sidequest.  Talk to Marco again to complete the [At Journey's End] sidequest and receive the PRIERE BONHEUR (ATK+15/MAG+52/Fear Res+5, equip on Raynie).</p>
      <p>When you are ready, return to the "Etherion" node and choose to "Reject the truce."  However, someone else has different ideas.</p>
      <BossCard name="Shadow x3" weakness="Poison">
        <p><strong>Strategy:</strong> Start by using Right Assault on the Shadow in the back row.  Then, use the Change command to string together five consecutive turns.  Lay any Star Trap in the lower left corner.  Finally, from the lower right Shadow, use Right Assault, Push Assault, Left Assault, and Left Assault to defeat them all, using Eruca's Trans-turn, as needed.</p>
      </BossCard>
      <Callout type="node" title="Historia Milestone: Royal Talisman">
        <p>[A Black Disciple node] After surviving the battle, everyone will discuss the assault on Granorg.</p>
      </Callout>
      <Callout type="note" title="Recommended Equipment">
        <p>Recommended Equipment at this point in the game<br/>
        <strong>Stocke:</strong> Pieti Edge, Moirae Manteau, Crystal Charm x3<br/>
        <strong>Raynie:</strong> Priere Bonheur, Tungsten Mail, Crystal Charm x3<br/>
        <strong>Marco:</strong> Gaia Blade, Tungsten Mail, Rook Stud x3<br/>
        <strong>Aht:</strong> Promised Knife, Giant Cape, Rook Stud x3<br/>
        <strong>Gafka:</strong> Death Claw, Bestial Soul, Beast Charm x3<br/>
        <strong>Eruca:</strong> Freikugel Argent, Skull Dress, Crystal Charm x3<br/>
        <strong>Extra:</strong> Gospel Armor</p>
      </Callout>
    </div>
  </ChapterCard>

  <!-- Chapter 58 -->
  <ChapterCard
    id="ch58"
    number={58}
    title="Gran Plain (Alternate Chapter 6)"
    timeline="Alternate"
  >
    <TacticalBriefing
      level="58" party="Stocke, Eruca, Gafka" enemies={[{"name": "Elderly Goblin"}, {"name": "Iron Knight"}, {"name": "Sniper"}]}
    />

    <div class="chapter-walkthrough-prose">
      <AsciiMap>
<pre>| |    S - Save Point      [Flux War node]
                   /  |    X - Obstacle        [The Royal Secret node]
         Gran    _|   |_   G - Grave           You will need to walk through
       Plain NW |      _|                      the Gran Plain as you did the
